  "en": "Ratio of annual energy of a PV plant with a tracking system to the same plant with fixed structure at optimum tilt, minimum / mean / maximum by province. Extracted as numbers from a congress paper (Quintero, Wallace, Alustiza, III Congreso Argentino de Energias Sustentables). Reference plant: 1 MWp, polycrystalline CS6P-250P, SMA-SC 1000MV, DC/AC 1, NASA climate, PVsyst, Perez model, no shading. Useful as a sanity check for the future tracker feature; epc_pv does not model trackers. Not verified (status pending review).",
